vitrine.options.particles.type.tooltip=Spawns this type of vanilla particle. Particles that mods draw without registering a type are only affected by the Particles option above.
vitrine.options.particles.type.modded_tooltip=Spawns this particle type, registered by a mod. The mod does not ship a name for it, so its id is shown.
